				"description": {
					"en": "Pure black and white inlays carry the identity. Physical ceramic shading, controlled reflections and soft bevels provide detail without a pixel-art treatment; white cells remain solid after extraction.",
					"zh": "黑白镶嵌构成标识。陶瓷明暗、克制反光与柔和倒角提供精致细节，不使用像素画处理；白色格块在抠图后依然保持不透明。"
				}
			},
			{
				"aspect": "presentation",
				"title": {
					"en": "Precision drafting grid",
					"zh": "精密制图格线"
				},
				"description": {
					"en": "Cool pale drafting paper uses fine Cartesian cells, larger construction divisions, registration crosses and a short ruler. Its separate soft floor shadow never enters transparent UI marks.",
					"zh": "浅冷色制图纸配细笛卡尔网格、较大的工程分区、定位十字与短标尺。背景和柔和地面投影独立保存，小型透明标记不带底纹或阴影。"
				}
			}
		],
